Aikido adaptations: renamed modules; native Spark.Options route validation;
existing Aikido structured errors; generic type-bearing envelopes; compiled
subscription patterns; immutable construction and lookup only. Upstream Zoi
schemas, Router DSL, mutation APIs, catalog, cache, and envelope rules are omitted.
The packaged upstream release contained no NOTICE or test files. Aikido's router
oracle and regression tests are locally authored, not copied upstream tests.
